**What would you like to be added**:

[predicateMetadata](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/e5f276a1ab226f3590634a240a6a82aa9fefcb49/pkg/scheduler/algorithm/predicates/metadata.go#L129) contains a collection of variables that gets populated before running predicates. We want to refactor it into a collection of types, where each type contains the variables used by a specific predicate.

```
type podAffinityMetadata struct {
  ... 
}
type evenPodSpreadingMetadata struct {
  ... 
}

type predicateMetadata struct {
  podAffinityMetadata *podAffinityMetadata
  evenPodSpreadMetadata *evenPodSpreadingMetadata
 ...
}

func producePodAffinityMetadata() *podAffinityMetadata {
 ... 
}
func produceEvenPodSpreadMetadata() *evenPodSpreadMetadata {
}

func producePredicateMetadata() *predicateMetadata {
   var predicateMetadata predicateMetadata{}
   predicateMetadata.podAffinityMetadata = producePodAffinityMetadata()
   predicateMetadata.evenPodSpreadMetadata = produceEvenPodSpreadMetadata()
...
 return &predicateMetadata
}
```

**Why is this needed**:
This is to facilitate their migration as PreFilters.

/sig scheduling
